// exe / DLL の版の情報 (エクスプローラーのプロパティの「詳細」に出る)。cmake/VersionResource.cmake が target ごとに作る
#include <winver.h>

VS_VERSION_INFO VERSIONINFO
FILEVERSION @denpachan_VERSION_MAJOR@,@denpachan_VERSION_MINOR@,@denpachan_VERSION_PATCH@,0
PRODUCTVERSION @denpachan_VERSION_MAJOR@,@denpachan_VERSION_MINOR@,@denpachan_VERSION_PATCH@,0
FILEFLAGSMASK VS_FFI_FILEFLAGSMASK
FILEFLAGS @DENPACHAN_FILE_FLAGS@
FILEOS VOS_NT_WINDOWS32
FILETYPE @DENPACHAN_FILE_TYPE@
FILESUBTYPE VFT2_UNKNOWN
BEGIN
    BLOCK "StringFileInfo"
    BEGIN
        BLOCK "040904b0"
        BEGIN
            VALUE "CompanyName", "RTA in Japan"
            VALUE "FileDescription", "@DENPACHAN_FILE_DESCRIPTION@"
            VALUE "FileVersion", "@denpachan_VERSION@"
            VALUE "InternalName", "@DENPACHAN_TARGET@"
            VALUE "LegalCopyright", "Copyright (c) 2026 RTA in Japan. MIT License"
            VALUE "OriginalFilename", "@DENPACHAN_FILE_NAME@"
            VALUE "ProductName", "denpachan"
            VALUE "ProductVersion", "@DENPACHAN_PRODUCT_VERSION@"
        END
    END
    BLOCK "VarFileInfo"
    BEGIN
        VALUE "Translation", 0x409, 1200
    END
END
